- [medium] codemirror-undo-crosses-docs (code-editor/CodeEditor.vue): external doc replacement enters undo history; one editor is reused across bundle files, so Ctrl+Z writes file A's text into file B. Fix: Transaction.addToHistory.of(false) + :key on RegoModuleEditor.
- [medium] dirty-guard-unparsed-yaml (AgentConfigEditorDrawer): close/unload/route guards ignore pending or invalid YAML text. Fix: hasUnsavedChanges in useOverlayDraft (flush + yaml text vs original).
- [medium] kv-clear-overlay-only-key (PluginCard setMapValue): emptying an overlay-only key unsets it and the row vanishes mid-edit. Fix: keep '' for keys absent from every base.
